@baseUrl = https://localhost:5001
@token = replace-with-a-development-token

### Request report
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/requests?page=1&pageSize=20&sortBy=createdAtUtc&sortDirection=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Approval history
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/approval-history?page=1&pageSize=20&sortBy=decidedAtUtc&sortDirection=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Workflow performance
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/workflow-performance?page=1&pageSize=20&sortBy=startedAtUtc&sortDirection=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Leave report
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/leave?page=1&pageSize=20&sortBy=startDate&sortDirection=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter options (role-scoped)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/filter-options
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
